		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Cistern-sized, gelatinous pile of fetid, demonic brown ooze that flows throughout the waters of the Abyss.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +8 (3d6 + smother) or 2 glob +8 (3d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Smother</strong>. If a target is hit by both slams in same round, it is coated by demon and suffocates in 2d4 rounds. STR 15+ on turn to escape.</p><p></p><p><strong>Turgid Water</strong>. While touching body of liquid, dimension door (self only). Contiguous liquid must connect end points.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
